{
  "format": 0,
  "id": "alhambra-museum-pointed-stars",
  "title": "Pointed stars of a tile panel in the Alhambra museum",
  "short": "Alhambra museum pointed stars",
  "subtitle": "Alhambra museum, Granada",
  "fold": 4,
  "star": 8,
  "style": "Nasrid",
  "level": "advanced",
  "construction": {
    "basis": "reconstruction",
    "fidelity": "not-applicable",
    "note": "The finished design was read from Brian Wichmann’s P008B drawing, its corners snapped to exact values. We devised the construction. Its lines are exactly those of the Arrayanes porch ceiling and the Nasrid textile stars, so the construction is the same; only the inked pieces differ. The star at O and the eight kites round it become one large star with sharp points. The drawing gives no steps.",
    "changes": "The compass steps, their order and the named points are ours. The comparison with the drawing checks the finished lines, not how the design was first laid out. The colours follow Wichmann’s drawing, which he took from the original; no photograph was checked.",
    "reviewed": "2026-10-26"
  },
  "credits": [
    {
      "source": "Tiling Search, data159/P008B: Granada museum",
      "creator": "Brian Wichmann",
      "url": "https://tilingsearch.mit.edu/HTML/data159/P008B.html",
      "kind": "drawing",
      "note": "Read from his finished drawing, not construction instructions. His reference is a photograph by John Rigby of a tile panel in the Alhambra museum, Granada (personal communication); he took the colours from the original and left out the decoration on the star. He links it to the Patio de los Arrayanes. The construction is ours."
    }
  ],
  "given": {"O": "The centre of a large eight-pointed star.", "A": "The centre of the next small star."},
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Draw a horizontal straight line through O and A. Draw a circle with centre O through A.",
      "create": {"c": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "through": "A"}}, "h": {"line": {"through": ["O", "A"]}}},
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Draw a vertical line through O. The two lines cross the circle at A, B, C and D. Draw a vertical line through each of A and B. Draw a horizontal line through each of C and D. These lines make the square cell, with corners K1, K2, K3 and K4. Draw a straight line through O and K1.",
      "create": {
        "v": {"line": {"through": "O", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "C": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 90.0}}},
        "B": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 180.0}}},
        "D": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 270.0}}},
        "gx": {"line": {"through": "A", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "gxw": {"line": {"through": "B", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "gy": {"line": {"through": "C", "perpendicularTo": "v"}},
        "gys": {"line": {"through": "D", "perpendicularTo": "v"}},
        "K1": {"point": {"meet": ["gx", "gy"]}},
        "K2": {"point": {"meet": ["gxw", "gy"]}},
        "K3": {"point": {"meet": ["gxw", "gys"]}},
        "K4": {"point": {"meet": ["gx", "gys"]}},
        "d45": {"line": {"through": ["O", "K1"]}}
      },
      "highlight": ["c", "h"],
      "animate": "ruler",
      "textWithoutHelpers": "Draw a vertical line through O. The two lines cross the circle at A, B, C and D. Draw a vertical line through A. Draw a horizontal line through C. They cross at K1, a corner of the cell. Draw a straight line through O and K1."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Draw the line through O that halves the angle at O between K1 and C. Draw a line through A at 90° to it. The two lines cross at T.",
      "create": {
        "l67": {"line": {"through": "O", "bisects": ["K1", "O", "C"]}},
        "ap": {"line": {"through": "A", "perpendicularTo": "l67"}},
        "T": {"point": {"meet": ["l67", "ap"]}}
      },
      "highlight": ["K1", "C", "T"],
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Draw a vertical line through T. Draw a line through T parallel to the line through O and K1. Turn the two lines round O by 90°, three times. They make the star at O.",
      "create": {
        "tv": {"line": {"through": "T", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "td": {"line": {"through": "T", "parallelTo": "d45"}},
        "st": {"repeat": {"of": ["tv", "td"], "by": "rot4"}}
      },
      "highlight": ["T"],
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The vertical line through T crosses the horizontal line through O at S. Draw a circle with centre K1 and radius OS. It crosses the horizontal line through C at U, left of K1. Draw a vertical line through U.",
      "create": {
        "S": {"point": {"meet": ["tv", "h"]}},
        "ku": {"circle": {"centre": "K1", "radiusFrom": ["O", "S"]}},
        "U": {"point": {"meet": ["ku", "gy"], "pick": {"angle": 49.517}}},
        "uv": {"line": {"through": "U", "parallelTo": "v"}}
      },
      "highlight": ["S", "U"],
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The line through T parallel to the line through O and K1 crosses the horizontal line through C at V. Draw a line through V at 90° to the line through O and K1. Turn the new lines through U and V round O by 90°, three times. With the lines through T, they make the stars at the corners.",
      "create": {
        "V": {"point": {"meet": ["td", "gy"]}},
        "vd": {"line": {"through": "V", "perpendicularTo": "d45"}},
        "ks": {"repeat": {"of": ["uv", "vd"], "by": "rot4"}}
      },
      "highlight": ["V"],
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "Another side of the star at O crosses the horizontal line through O at N. Draw a circle with centre A and radius ON. It crosses the horizontal line through O at W, left of A. Draw a circle with centre O through W. It crosses the line through O and K1 at X.",
      "create": {
        "N": {"point": {"meet": ["td@3", "h"]}},
        "an": {"circle": {"centre": "A", "radiusFrom": ["O", "N"]}},
        "W": {"point": {"meet": ["an", "h"], "pick": {"nearest": "O"}}},
        "cw": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "through": "W"}},
        "X": {"point": {"meet": ["cw", "d45"], "pick": {"angle": 45.0}}}
      },
      "highlight": ["N", "W", "X"],
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "Draw a circle with centre K1 and the same radius as the circle through W. It crosses the line through O and K1 at Y. It crosses the horizontal line through C at Z. Draw a circle with centre O through Y. It crosses the horizontal line through O at G.",
      "create": {
        "kw": {"circle": {"centre": "K1", "radiusOf": "cw"}},
        "Y": {"point": {"meet": ["kw", "d45"], "pick": {"nearest": "O"}}},
        "Z": {"point": {"meet": ["kw", "gy"], "pick": {"angle": 78.299}}},
        "cy": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "through": "Y"}},
        "G": {"point": {"meet": ["cy", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 0.0}}}
      },
      "highlight": ["Y", "Z", "G"],
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "Draw a horizontal line through each of X and Y. Draw a line through each of W, Z and G at 90° to the line through O and K1. Turn the five new lines round O by 90°, three times.",
      "create": {
        "xh": {"line": {"through": "X", "parallelTo": "h"}},
        "yh": {"line": {"through": "Y", "parallelTo": "h"}},
        "wd": {"line": {"through": "W", "perpendicularTo": "d45"}},
        "zd": {"line": {"through": "Z", "perpendicularTo": "d45"}},
        "gd": {"line": {"through": "G", "perpendicularTo": "d45"}},
        "fr": {"repeat": {"of": ["xh", "yh", "wd", "zd", "gd"], "by": "rot4"}}
      },
      "highlight": ["X", "Y", "W", "Z", "G"],
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "Join K1, K2, K3 and K4 to mark the tile that repeats.",
      "create": {"tile": {"polygon": ["K1", "K2", "K3", "K4"]}},
      "animate": "fade"
    }
  ],
